// The apps are the facade apps of .work/proto/kyoui-facades/{zio,cats}/apps, unchanged. Ctrl-C quits (they have no quit key).

// claude 2026-10-03: created the ZIO mains (ZIOAppDefault + tui4s.interop.zio.ui.Tui.run)
